ds per attempt. In lib/b.dart, there's a delay of 5 seconds. The imported file (lib/c.dart) has a delay of 15 seconds. Adding those together: 10 + 5 + 15 = 30 seconds. So the total is 30 seconds.\n","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"},"output_index":0,"sequence_number":270,"type":"response.output_item.done"}

